    "Kafka transaction guarantees do not automatically include arbitrary external database writes. Define the boundary precisely and make side effects safe to repeat.",
    "Can adding consumers always increase parallelism in one group?", "No. Under conventional partition assignment, a partition is assigned to one consumer in the group at a time; consumers beyond available partitions can be idle.",
